          "distinct": true,
          "id": "13193996ba502bdc1d400371f32e25aa7e0251e3",
          "message": "Add neural network pruning to deep_learn (elastic net, magnitude pruning)\n\nThree independent pruning techniques, each optional via SQL named args:\n\n- Elastic Net (l1_ratio): proximal gradient descent (ISTA) creates\n  sparse weights, warm-started from ridge solution, GPU-accelerated\n- Magnitude Pruning (prune_ratio): post-training threshold zeroes\n  smallest weights by percentile\n- Combined: L1 sparsity pattern + magnitude pruning for max compression\n\nSQL: lambda => 1.0, l1_ratio => 0.3, prune_ratio => 0.5\nPython: engine.deep_learn(..., l1_ratio=0.3, prune_ratio=0.5)\n\nMNIST pruning showcase (deep_learn_mnist_pruning.py):\n  50% pruning: 94.68% test accuracy (baseline 97.89%, -3.2pp)\n  Elastic net + magnitude pruning combined configurations\n\n4 pruning tests added (elastic net, magnitude, combined, SQL syntax).",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-20T12:43:42+09:00",
