          "message": "Release v0.22.0 — global pooling, kernel initialization, vector calibration\n\nVersion bump to 0.22.0 across pyproject.toml, __init__.py, CITATION.cff.\nHISTORY.md: v0.22.0 release notes (global pooling, kernel init modes,\nPaper 5 vector calibration, 2788 tests across 83 files).\nREADME.md: global_pool in layer table, init modes in deep_learn, test count.\ndocs/references: Paper 5 section in uqa-reference.md (Section 2.5),\nvector calibration in technical-overview.md (Section 3.4), global_pool\nand init_mode in usql-manual, usql-grammar, uqa-reference, uqa-api-manual.\nCITATION.cff: 7 new keywords, date 2026-03-23.",
