          "distinct": true,
          "id": "33732f4328bcd60041d5702e7a256e5115f87484",
          "message": "Fix multi-channel NumPy fallback in grid_forward\n\nThe NumPy fallback path reshaped input to (N, H, W) — single channel\nonly — so multi-channel kernels (C_out, C_in, 3, 3) collapsed to a\nsingle 2D kernel, producing wrong feature dimensions. Reshape to\n(N, C_in, H, W) and iterate over (C_out, C_in) pairs, matching the\nPyTorch F.conv2d behavior. Pooling axes shift from (2, 4) to (3, 5)\nto account for the channel dimension.",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-23T22:47:11+09:00",
          "tree_id": "6a745df3fcb0c597472519fd1fb6c1e5403175d7",
          "url": "https://github.com/cognica-io/uqa/commit/33732f4328bcd60041d5702e7a256e5115f87484"
