          "distinct": true,
          "id": "4790b568119ce0165d4df2c881747cda8fc4c3c1",
          "message": "Release v0.22.1 — CJK text analysis, thread-safe IVF, JOIN predicate pushdown, parameter binding\n\nASCIIFoldingFilter now preserves CJK/Korean characters by folding\nper-character instead of per-token; characters without ASCII equivalents\nare kept as-is.  ManagedConnection creates per-thread read-only SQLite\nconnections for parallel fusion signal execution, fixing cursor\ninterleaving crashes in IVF searches.  JOIN queries with UQA functions\n(text_match, knn_match, fuse_log_odds, etc.) in WHERE clauses are\ncorrectly pushed down to table scans via _CompiledWhereScanOperator.\n$N parameter binding works across all DML/DQL paths including\nExprEvaluator, ExprProjectOp, ExprFilterOp, and join operators.",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-25T20:57:51+09:00",
          "tree_id": "e5eaea9bd81cd37e3c72464bc3c3a434b039dd12",
