          "distinct": true,
          "id": "1268a3da82a0fe8074a688c943f2df7a13e72210",
          "message": "Release v0.24.0 — SQL faceted search and search result highlighting\n\nAdd uqa_highlight() and uqa_facets() SQL functions for search-engine-style\nresult highlighting and faceted search over full-text query results.\n\nuqa_highlight(field, query [, start_tag, end_tag, max_fragments, fragment_size])\nreturns field text with matched terms wrapped in tags. Uses the table's analyzer\nfor stemming-aware matching. Supports custom tags and snippet extraction with\nword-boundary-snapped fragments.\n\nuqa_facets(field [, field2, ...]) computes facet value counts over the\nWHERE-filtered posting list. Single-field returns facet_value|facet_count;\nmulti-field adds a facet_field column. Respects all WHERE predicates including\n@@, text_match, and relational filters.\n\nNew uqa/search/ package with highlight core logic and FTS query term extraction.\nAll 2831 tests pass across 84 test files.",
          "timestamp": "2026-04-01T17:24:39+09:00",
