          "id": "d0fee595811411ee3696cfac5ff7aa106e2aadc5",
          "message": "Add query cancellation mechanism (v0.25.2)\n\nCancellationToken with threading.Event allows thread-safe cancellation\nof in-flight queries. Engine.cancel() signals the token, and operators\ncheck it in their hot loops (SeqScan, Filter, Sort, HashAgg, Distinct,\nWindow, InnerJoin, CrossJoin, LeftOuterJoin, FullOuterJoin).",
