          "distinct": true,
          "id": "d70c71bbba81bdb6360fb9059bc51b2ca1a42e5c",
          "message": "Fix per-field analyzer in all-field FTS search (v0.25.4)\n\nAll-field full-text search was using only the index-level default\nanalyzer for every field.  When a GIN index covers fields with\ndifferent analyzers (e.g. standard_cjk vs english_stem), this\nproduced incorrect tokens at search time.  TermOperator,\n_compile_fts_tree, and _compile_phrase now iterate each field's\nown search analyzer and union the results.",
          "timestamp": "2026-04-07T23:39:29+09:00",
          "tree_id": "d6d5abe5d3c8b9081501b1e578b3d2f8482b160a",
          "url": "https://github.com/cognica-io/uqa/commit/d70c71bbba81bdb6360fb9059bc51b2ca1a42e5c"
