          "id": "32bf431a40d1d2a7a869bc4b22c9e7436ec2c084",
          "message": "Add standalone property graph SQL functions (v0.25.5)\n\nSix new FROM-clause functions for creating, querying, traversing, and\ndeleting graph nodes and edges entirely through SQL: graph_create_node,\ngraph_create_edge, graph_nodes, graph_neighbors, graph_delete_node, and\ngraph_delete_edge. Nodes are independent entities with auto-generated IDs\nand JSON properties, operating on named graphs.",
